@ENTER SYSTEM,<SYSTEM-PASSWORD>,,<PROJECT>
@CC ===================================================================
@CC (SYSTEM)LOAD-MODE:BATC   --- GENERIC TEMPLATE (thin batch wrapper) ---
@CC The ONLY things here are the batch-specific bits: log in, run the
@CC real warm-start config (LOAD-MODE:MODE), announce, terminate.
@CC ALL configuration lives in LOAD-MODE:MODE (no password there) so
@CC nothing is duplicated. This file holds the SYSTEM password ->
@CC set file access PUBLIC=N FRIEND=N. Replace the <TOKEN>s.
@CC ===================================================================
@MODE (SYSTEM)LOAD-MODE:MODE,,,
@CC
@CC --- Announce availability (MAIL broadcast; && is a batch escape) ----
@MAIL
@DIRECT-BROADCAST
$$
SYSTEM IS AVAILABLE
$$
&
EXIT
&&
